1
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,880
Americans have ceremonies

2
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,550
for everything.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,360
Graduation ceremonies, for

4
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,100
example. We've all seen it in

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,330
American TV shows.

6
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,160
That ceremony where the graduate is

7
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,760
in a suit, with friends, family,

8
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,900
the university professors, the

9
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,060
staff, even recruiters

10
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,020
offering the graduate a job

11
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,240
right there.

12
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,520
The graduate takes his cap,

13
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,700
throws it in the air: woohoo!

14
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,150
In France, it's slightly different.

15
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,620
In France you get a letter from uni

16
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,680
with your name, your stamp, your envelope

17
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,710
and even your handwriting on it.

18
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,710
You collect your diploma in

19
00:00:57,710 --> 00:00:58,740
a crappy little office,

20
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:00,990
an old secretary hands it over like

21
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:02,970
garbage. Then you head

22
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:04,820
straight to the nearest job centre.

23
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:12,370
There you meet an adviser

24
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:14,470
who looks at you with a mix of

25
00:01:14,470 --> 00:01:16,520
pity and satisfaction, because

26
00:01:20,790 --> 00:01:22,410
he knows full well he doesn't have

27
00:01:22,410 --> 00:01:23,970
a quarter of your education, but he doesn't

28
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:24,520
care.

29
00:01:25,610 --> 00:01:26,540
He's got a job.

30
00:01:28,370 --> 00:01:30,110
And he offers you something great:

31
00:01:30,110 --> 00:01:32,070
"I've got a great one for you:

32
00:01:32,070 --> 00:01:34,190
a youth job-integration internship,

33
00:01:34,190 --> 00:01:36,350
temporary, of unlimited

34
00:01:36,350 --> 00:01:39,300
duration, unpaid, but you pay.

35
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,430
In Romania."
